==Battleground==
*2 [[Sir Metal Seal]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*2 [[Sir Metal Seal]]s spawn after 83.33 seconds<sup>2,500f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Simple enough: bring lots of [[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|Critters]] and many meatshields instead of [[Primordial Cat (Rare Cat)|Modern Cat]]. [[Tecoluga (Uber Rare Cat)|Tesalan Pasalan]] can take out each Sir Metal Seal with one Crit, but this requires great luck and may take a few tries. If you have [[Marauder Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Paladin Cat]] or [[Graveflower Verbena (Uber Rare Cat)|Verbena the Bride]], this stage becomes much easier, as you only need to send out Paladin and meatshields. On the one hand, the lack of peons means very little money; on the other, it guarantees that your Critters and crowd-controllers will always focus on a Sir Metal Seal and not get distracted by something weaker.

